<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Parts on brainboxemb</title><link>https://brainboxemb.github.io/notes/projects/2026/001-hub75-display/concepts-and-ideas/enclosure/parts/</link><description>Recent content in Parts on brainboxemb</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://brainboxemb.github.io/notes/projects/2026/001-hub75-display/concepts-and-ideas/enclosure/parts/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Feet for the Enclosure</title><link>https://brainboxemb.github.io/notes/projects/2026/001-hub75-display/concepts-and-ideas/enclosure/parts/feet/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://brainboxemb.github.io/notes/projects/2026/001-hub75-display/concepts-and-ideas/enclosure/parts/feet/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This page contains possible feet for the HUB75 display enclosure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prices were checked in July 2026 and may change over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="requirements"&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The feet should:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;protect the enclosure and the surface underneath it;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;provide some grip;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;keep the enclosure stable;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;be suitable for mounting underneath the wooden enclosure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="hornbach"&gt;Hornbach&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id="tarrox-door-stopper"&gt;TARROX door stopper&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
